#: ../../fundamentals/index.rst:2
msgid "Fundamentals and usage"
msgstr "基础概念与用法"

#: ../../fundamentals/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"This section introduces the fundamentals you need before running "
"synthesis or fitting in PySME. It covers the key data structures and "
"controls that define spectra, line selection, and model behavior."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍在 PySME 中进行光谱合成或拟合之前需要掌握的基础内容。它涵盖定义光谱、谱线选择和模型行为的关键数据结构与控制参数。"
